THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. This repository bundles no third-party code, declares no package
dependencies, and loads no external resources at runtime. The tooling runs on
the Node.js standard library alone, which is deliberate: the framework has to
run inside a disconnected enclave where no package manager is available.

If that ever changes, this section records the component, its license, and its
obligations before the dependency is merged.

