FILE FORMATS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Diagram interchange files in visuals/ use the tldraw v2 file format (.tldr),
which is plain JSON. This repository contains diagram data only. It does not
bundle, embed, or distribute the tldraw editor or any tldraw source code, and
it imposes no tldraw licensing obligation on users of this repository. Anyone
choosing to embed the tldraw editor in their own product is responsible for
that product's licensing.
